<div mt-section-origin="Bookshelves/Organic_Chemistry/Supplemental_Modules_(Organic_Chemistry)/Reactions/Reactivity_of_Alpha_Hydrogens/Aldol_Reaction" class="mt-section"><span id="Example_3"></span><h5 class="box-legend lt-chem-1155" id="Example_3-1155"><span class="lt-icon-default">Example 3</span></h5>

